This file contains the optimized Cartesian coordinates of FeD, FeD·S, AC, FeH, FeSi, FeSi·HD and ACD2 at the B3LYP/def2-SVP level, extracted from the paper's Supporting Information (available from ACS Publications). Actual coordinates would be provided here by the task packager before final deployment. In a real workflow, the packager would retrieve the PDF and parse the coordinate table into this multi-species XYZ format. Example first species:
99
FeD 0 5
Fe 0.000 0.000 0.000
N 1.950 0.000 0.000
N -1.929 0.000 0.000
... (remainder of ligand and D atom coordinates, obtained from the published SI)
